# Yue, the Moon Spirit: "You may cast a noncreature spell from your hand without paying its mana cost." Grist, the Hunger Tide is a planeswalker
# card, but "as long as Grist isn't on the battlefield, it's a 1/1 Insect creature in addition to its other types" (a characteristic-defining
# ability that works in every zone), so cast from hand it is a creature spell (CR 601.3e): the spell it would be is judged, not its printed
# type line. Bot1 holds Lightning Bolt and Grist (drawn this turn); after combat Yue pays waterbend {5} and only the Bolt is offered.

